WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.920
=Episode 19=

01:41.270 --> 01:41.830
Good morning.

01:41.990 --> 01:42.590
Commander Xiao.

01:42.910 --> 01:43.509
Miss He.

01:43.830 --> 01:45.070
Let's have breakfast together.

01:46.950 --> 01:47.580
Please.

01:51.910 --> 01:52.750
Actually,

01:52.870 --> 01:53.870
I've known for a while

01:53.990 --> 01:55.590
you're not my elder brother's son.

01:59.870 --> 02:00.950
Your act

02:00.950 --> 02:02.070
was quite convincing.

02:02.550 --> 02:03.590
Since Her Highness knew

02:03.590 --> 02:04.790
you came to Jiyang

02:04.830 --> 02:05.950
and yet did nothing,

02:05.990 --> 02:07.190
she must have her plans.

02:07.390 --> 02:08.310
In that case,

02:08.590 --> 02:10.430
I had to play the fool.

02:12.310 --> 02:13.950
You're a master of disguise.

02:14.150 --> 02:14.870
I'm impressed.

02:15.470 --> 02:17.110
To become Princess Mengji's right hand,

02:17.630 --> 02:18.230
you must be

02:18.950 --> 02:20.070
exceptionally clever.

02:21.310 --> 02:23.190
Not as astute as you.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.230
Let's have breakfast together.

02:29.750 --> 02:30.340
Please.

02:39.829 --> 02:40.310
Mr. Chu.

02:42.950 --> 02:43.910
Mr. He, good morning.

02:43.990 --> 02:44.750
Good morning.

02:45.750 --> 02:47.829
But now I should call you Miss He.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.550
You're still mistaken.

02:51.310 --> 02:51.950
Currently,

02:52.950 --> 02:54.230
you should call her Mrs. Qiao.

03:00.230 --> 03:01.550
We have a visit to make, right?

03:01.910 --> 03:02.470
Let's go.

03:03.550 --> 03:04.070
Go.

03:04.830 --> 03:05.630
Don't miss the time.

03:09.790 --> 03:10.400
Mr. Chu.

03:10.550 --> 03:11.390
I'll take my leave.

03:38.270 --> 03:39.150
Speak your mind.

03:41.590 --> 03:42.750
How did you know

03:43.150 --> 03:44.550
I was visiting an elder?

03:45.390 --> 03:46.990
You dressed formally this morning,

03:47.670 --> 03:49.070
obviously to meet someone.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.470
In all of Jiyang,

03:51.070 --> 03:52.670
the only one worthy of such formality

03:53.190 --> 03:54.150
would be your master.

03:54.590 --> 03:56.230
My master once told me

03:56.550 --> 03:57.510
that if needed,

03:57.670 --> 03:58.870
I could find him in Jiyang.

03:59.550 --> 04:00.350
I assumed

04:00.510 --> 04:01.710
he was merely enjoying nature

04:01.950 --> 04:02.710
but never imagined

04:02.990 --> 04:04.270
there was a hidden story.

04:10.230 --> 04:10.910
What story?

04:11.910 --> 04:13.190
If it's hidden,

04:13.510 --> 04:14.830
it can't be revealed.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.190
Commander,

04:16.550 --> 04:18.029
please don't press me.

04:19.630 --> 04:19.990
Fine.

04:20.790 --> 04:21.790
I don't care to know.

04:23.230 --> 04:23.870
Thank you.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.010
Thank you.

04:40.790 --> 04:41.590
Thank you, Master.

04:43.110 --> 04:43.870
Master Yunlin.

04:44.950 --> 04:45.990
When did you arrive here?

04:50.070 --> 04:51.510
Around each Water God Festival,

04:51.909 --> 04:53.710
I return to Jiyang City.

04:54.350 --> 04:55.190
This time,

04:55.390 --> 04:56.950
I discovered Wutuo spies

04:57.350 --> 04:58.950
disguised as civilians.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.070
So,

05:00.310 --> 05:01.510
I tracked them secretly

05:02.270 --> 05:02.790
and indeed,

05:03.430 --> 05:04.390
these Wutuo spies

05:04.910 --> 05:06.870
used the festival crowds

05:07.190 --> 05:08.590
to kidnap the young princess

05:08.870 --> 05:10.430
to blackmail Princess Mengji.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.550
The kidnapping

05:13.470 --> 05:14.390
is just the first step.

05:15.550 --> 05:16.350
Now, Wutuo agents

05:16.350 --> 05:17.910
move freely through Jiyang,

05:18.750 --> 05:19.990
like water eroding stone.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.390
This was long planned.

05:22.110 --> 05:22.790
Her Highness

05:22.950 --> 05:23.670
dislikes

05:23.750 --> 05:24.630
our interference

05:25.390 --> 05:26.150
but has enhanced

05:26.150 --> 05:27.150
security checks.

05:27.710 --> 05:29.030
Let's hope it helps.

05:30.110 --> 05:32.510
It feels like a storm
is brewing in Jiyang City.

05:33.150 --> 05:34.470
Something major approaches.

05:39.550 --> 05:40.190
You continue.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.350
I need fresh air.

05:49.150 --> 05:50.550
Ask what you wish.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.230
Master.

05:55.750 --> 05:57.390
Did you stay in Jiyang

05:57.470 --> 05:58.550
for Princess Mengji?

05:59.390 --> 06:01.670
Or is there another reason?

06:02.270 --> 06:03.830
Even if she weren't Princess Mengji,

06:04.790 --> 06:06.430
I won't stand idly by

06:06.590 --> 06:07.510
and see the people

06:07.910 --> 06:09.430
in Jiyang suffer.

06:10.190 --> 06:11.390
Isn't it the same between you

06:11.630 --> 06:12.590
and General Fengyun?

06:16.510 --> 06:17.590
You're right.

06:18.110 --> 06:19.070
I was small-minded.

06:20.790 --> 06:21.750
But Master,

06:22.430 --> 06:23.110
you...

06:23.910 --> 06:25.470
Do you truly have no wish to see

06:25.910 --> 06:27.070
Princess Mengji again?

06:30.630 --> 06:32.070
You have much work to attend to.

06:32.510 --> 06:33.550
I won't keep you longer.

06:47.030 --> 06:47.750
Your master

06:48.310 --> 06:49.590
seems burdened.

06:50.190 --> 06:51.390
Even you noticed.

07:13.590 --> 07:14.430
I don't know

07:14.430 --> 07:15.550
Master Yunlin well,

07:16.550 --> 07:17.090
but

07:18.310 --> 07:20.550
this melody clearly reveals deep sorrow.

07:23.190 --> 07:25.630
You truly are a master of music.

07:26.630 --> 07:28.470
People may conceal truths,

07:29.670 --> 07:31.910
but instruments never lie.

07:37.030 --> 07:38.270
If I recall correctly,

07:38.909 --> 07:40.030
Princess Mengji also played

07:40.030 --> 07:40.950
this melody before?

07:45.470 --> 07:47.030
They truly share a profound connection.

07:54.450 --> 07:57.980
(Peaceful Land)

08:07.710 --> 08:08.290
Commander,

08:08.950 --> 08:09.870
Mr. Cui needs you

08:10.150 --> 08:10.990
for urgent matters.

08:12.910 --> 08:13.870
I'll take my leave.

08:14.270 --> 08:14.850
And you?

08:14.950 --> 08:15.830
You should return.

08:16.110 --> 08:17.070
I'll walk around

08:17.310 --> 08:18.110
and secretly inspect

08:18.190 --> 08:18.990
the defenses.

08:25.010 --> 08:26.270
(South Gate)

08:26.270 --> 08:26.980
Next.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.490
Go.

08:32.070 --> 08:32.640
Next.

08:35.710 --> 08:36.309
Next.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.309
Next.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.200
Go.

08:46.510 --> 08:47.200
Go.

08:49.270 --> 08:49.890
Go.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.510
Princess Mengji is decisive.

08:52.790 --> 08:53.750
A masterful defender.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.060
Next.

09:04.790 --> 09:05.990
I truly hope Jiyang City

09:06.310 --> 09:07.710
can maintain this peace

09:07.790 --> 09:08.750
and harmony forever.

09:38.550 --> 09:39.150
Mr. Chu?

09:39.350 --> 09:40.110
Why is it you?

09:41.710 --> 09:42.390
I'm sorry.

09:43.070 --> 09:43.750
I startled you?

09:44.350 --> 09:44.930
It's nothing.

09:45.270 --> 09:46.390
These are turbulent times.

09:46.590 --> 09:47.830
Caution is only natural.

09:48.070 --> 09:49.150
Please don't take offense.

09:50.310 --> 09:51.350
Actually,

09:51.750 --> 09:52.870
I want to apologize to you.

09:53.590 --> 09:54.270
Apologize?

09:55.070 --> 09:55.670
Why?

09:56.350 --> 09:58.670
Last time, it was I who invited you

09:58.710 --> 10:00.230
to admire the moon over Mount Baiyue.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.710
But urgent matters arose,

10:02.070 --> 10:02.670
and I left.

10:04.070 --> 10:04.950
Nothing.

10:05.110 --> 10:06.230
Don't take it seriously.

10:06.830 --> 10:08.070
Moreover,

10:08.550 --> 10:10.110
I did gain something else that night.

10:14.990 --> 10:15.870
You hold no grudge

10:16.230 --> 10:17.350
due to your magnanimity.

10:17.790 --> 10:18.910
I cannot pretend

10:18.950 --> 10:19.710
it never happened.

10:20.510 --> 10:21.630
I must apologize.

10:22.430 --> 10:22.980
By the way,

10:23.830 --> 10:25.190
let me give you a gift, Miss He.

10:25.750 --> 10:26.400
What?

10:28.110 --> 10:29.110
Last time we met,

10:29.670 --> 10:30.550
I noticed

10:30.710 --> 10:31.750
you wore a purple whip

10:31.790 --> 10:32.630
at your waist.

10:33.150 --> 10:33.910
By chance,

10:33.990 --> 10:34.910
I obtained this tassel.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.390
I think it suits you perfectly.

10:37.830 --> 10:38.470
Try it on.

10:38.670 --> 10:39.790
See if it's better.

10:43.430 --> 10:43.990
Mr. Chu,

10:44.470 --> 10:45.310
I can't accept it.

10:45.550 --> 10:46.270
Forget it.

10:46.710 --> 10:47.390
Besides,

10:47.590 --> 10:48.670
this tassel appears

10:48.830 --> 10:49.750
quite valuable.

10:51.070 --> 10:52.030
You call me Mr. Chu.

10:52.190 --> 10:53.190
We're friends.

10:53.350 --> 10:54.030
Between friends,

10:54.150 --> 10:55.430
exchanging gifts is natural.

10:55.510 --> 10:56.190
Besides,

10:56.670 --> 10:57.830
this tassel isn't costly,

10:58.030 --> 10:59.150
so feel no obligation.

11:01.340 --> 11:01.950
Okay.

11:01.950 --> 11:02.710
I'll accept it.

11:03.510 --> 11:05.030
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

11:15.110 --> 11:15.830
Perfect match.

11:18.230 --> 11:19.110
In return,

11:19.510 --> 11:21.030
I should give you something, Mr. Chu.

11:27.910 --> 11:28.950
- Sir.
- Miss.

11:28.950 --> 11:30.310
Which is the priciest one

11:30.310 --> 11:30.830
here?

11:30.910 --> 11:31.710
The floral basket.

11:31.910 --> 11:32.870
Would you like one?

11:33.110 --> 11:33.990
Yes, give me one.

11:34.030 --> 11:34.630
Alright.

11:36.270 --> 11:37.230
May I draw it myself?

11:37.590 --> 11:38.270
Certainly.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.070
Here you go.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.590
Done.

12:38.950 --> 12:39.470
How's this?

12:39.750 --> 12:40.590
Do you like it?

12:45.550 --> 12:46.190
Zilan

12:46.270 --> 12:47.430
means fragrant orchid.

12:47.750 --> 12:48.870
The person who named you

12:48.950 --> 12:49.830
loved you certainly.

12:50.190 --> 12:52.390
They surely wished you noble virtues

12:52.510 --> 12:53.310
and a good future,

12:53.590 --> 12:54.830
so you got this elegant name.

12:55.190 --> 12:55.740
This is

12:55.950 --> 12:56.950
my reciprocal gift.

12:57.230 --> 12:57.830
Mr. Chu,

12:57.910 --> 12:59.350
don't mock my clumsy handwriting.

13:00.790 --> 13:01.590
How could I?

13:01.830 --> 13:02.630
I'm deeply honored.

13:05.470 --> 13:06.030
Burn him!

13:06.150 --> 13:07.310
- Burn him!
- Burn him!

13:17.230 --> 13:17.750
Mr. Chu.

13:19.830 --> 13:20.390
Mr. Chu.

13:21.790 --> 13:22.590
It's okay.

13:23.350 --> 13:24.030
Are you

13:24.790 --> 13:25.830
afraid of fire?

13:31.430 --> 13:32.190
Thank goodness

13:32.790 --> 13:33.510
this isn't ruined.

13:41.400 --> 13:44.190
(Mengji Mansion)

13:47.350 --> 13:48.390
Jiyang's defenses

13:48.710 --> 13:49.670
remain well-fortified.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.430
Let's hope so.

13:56.390 --> 13:56.910
Commander.

14:03.710 --> 14:04.350
Commander.

14:04.550 --> 14:05.510
Where are you going?

14:06.630 --> 14:07.230
Just walking.

14:08.070 --> 14:08.910
Then I'll join you.

14:14.470 --> 14:16.110
This is a gift from Mr. Chu.

14:19.430 --> 14:20.830
Miss He also gave me a gift.

14:21.830 --> 14:22.830
I like it very much.

14:30.030 --> 14:31.630
She once sent me osmanthus candies,

14:32.430 --> 14:33.270
a whole handful,

14:35.110 --> 14:36.110
more than I could eat.

14:39.310 --> 14:41.390
The characters "Zilan"
on this sugar painting

14:42.150 --> 14:44.070
were written by Miss He herself.

14:49.510 --> 14:50.390
This food is fragile.

14:51.190 --> 14:52.710
You should keep it carefully

14:53.350 --> 14:53.950
in case you

14:54.590 --> 14:55.790
end up with nothing.

14:57.950 --> 14:58.990
Thank you for the advice.

14:59.270 --> 15:00.790
I'll preserve it with utmost care.

15:06.350 --> 15:07.990
If you both enjoy sweets so much,

15:08.350 --> 15:09.670
I'll buy more in the future.

15:10.470 --> 15:11.070
Commander.

15:14.830 --> 15:15.910
Several crucial granaries

15:15.950 --> 15:16.590
are ablaze.

15:16.910 --> 15:17.710
Very fiercely.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.030
It's the Wutuo's doing.

15:20.390 --> 15:21.190
Assist Mr. Cui

15:21.270 --> 15:21.910
in it.

15:22.750 --> 15:23.360
Yes.

15:25.510 --> 15:26.310
Let's discuss it

15:26.590 --> 15:27.430
with Princess Mengji.

15:28.350 --> 15:28.900
Agreed.

15:38.110 --> 15:40.830
Fire! The granary's on fire!

15:45.230 --> 15:46.230
It's the Wutuo people.

15:47.470 --> 15:48.670
They've made their move.

16:00.190 --> 16:01.510
Quite the spectacle.

16:02.150 --> 16:03.230
Those Wutuo people

16:03.470 --> 16:04.830
grow more audacious by the day.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.790
Doesn't this situation feel

16:06.790 --> 16:07.710
all too familiar?

16:08.830 --> 16:09.430
Mingshui

16:09.870 --> 16:10.510
and Que City

16:10.710 --> 16:11.990
both witnessed similar things.

16:12.950 --> 16:13.630
The Wutuo people

16:13.750 --> 16:15.070
breached the defenses easily

16:15.270 --> 16:16.190
and launched attacks.

16:16.990 --> 16:18.670
This time, Chancellor Xu aided them.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.110
As for the previous two...

16:24.830 --> 16:26.030
After this,

16:26.350 --> 16:27.990
Xiao Jue won't let this slide.

16:28.350 --> 16:29.110
Go take a look.

17:13.550 --> 17:14.750
Skip the formalities.

17:15.270 --> 17:16.069
You've come.

17:16.829 --> 17:17.390
Lou,

17:17.990 --> 17:19.230
they're your life savers.

17:19.630 --> 17:20.390
Have you forgotten

17:20.390 --> 17:21.190
your manners?

17:21.349 --> 17:22.550
How could you act like this?

17:25.829 --> 17:26.470
Commander Xiao.

17:26.990 --> 17:28.190
I was just about to see you.

17:28.830 --> 17:29.550
As you observed,

17:30.230 --> 17:31.550
Wutuo is watching hungrily.

17:31.950 --> 17:33.270
The situation in Jiyang City

17:33.510 --> 17:35.510
grows more dire by the day.

17:36.110 --> 17:37.550
Though I've dispatched troops

17:37.670 --> 17:38.950
and increased security,

17:39.230 --> 17:40.110
the Wutuo people

17:40.550 --> 17:41.550
are moving faster.

17:41.990 --> 17:42.790
How many men

17:43.390 --> 17:44.270
are stationed here?

17:45.470 --> 17:46.150
Under 20,000.

17:48.590 --> 17:49.270
We've captured

17:49.270 --> 17:50.750
some Wutuo infiltrators,

17:51.430 --> 17:52.990
but it won't turn the tide.

17:53.830 --> 17:55.710
Wutuo has already launched its attack.

17:56.110 --> 17:57.710
This will be a bitter struggle.

17:59.150 --> 18:00.870
Though Jiyang lacks manpower,

18:01.190 --> 18:02.230
we'll never retreat.

18:02.870 --> 18:04.110
I'll hold my position here

18:04.910 --> 18:05.870
and stand with Jiyang

18:06.630 --> 18:07.550
to the last breath.

18:10.390 --> 18:10.950
I'd like

18:11.870 --> 18:13.350
to offer my assistance.

18:29.230 --> 18:30.710
Leaving your post at Yezhou

18:30.990 --> 18:32.150
is a breach of military law.

18:32.670 --> 18:33.710
Commanding troops now

18:34.310 --> 18:34.990
would bring

18:35.390 --> 18:36.830
graver consequences.

18:37.870 --> 18:38.630
Do you truly

18:39.070 --> 18:40.030
risk such repercussions

18:40.710 --> 18:42.230
for Jiyang's sake?

18:43.310 --> 18:44.510
As a Wei general,

18:45.110 --> 18:45.910
it's my duty

18:46.790 --> 18:47.710
to protect the people.

18:52.830 --> 18:55.030
I'll contribute my efforts, too.

18:57.630 --> 18:58.210
Good.

18:59.190 --> 18:59.950
From this moment,

19:00.550 --> 19:01.910
all Jiyang troops

19:02.310 --> 19:03.710
will obey Commander Xiao's orders.

19:10.630 --> 19:11.830
Our people's safety

19:12.510 --> 19:13.830
rests in your hands, Commander.

19:16.150 --> 19:17.310
I'll spare no effort

19:17.870 --> 19:19.150
to defend Jiyang to the last.

19:31.750 --> 19:32.350
Your Highness,

19:33.030 --> 19:34.550
the war looms imminent.

19:35.070 --> 19:35.710
Perhaps

19:35.710 --> 19:36.750
the young princess

19:36.950 --> 19:38.030
should be sent away.

19:38.950 --> 19:39.950
I'm staying here.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.390
I remain with Mother

19:41.830 --> 19:43.270
and our people

19:43.310 --> 19:44.150
no matter what.

19:53.950 --> 19:54.470
So be it.

19:55.390 --> 19:56.670
You'll stay by my side, Lou.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.870
I'll keep you safe,

19:59.230 --> 20:00.270
whatever the cost.

20:19.190 --> 20:24.830
(Self-Revealing Virtue)

20:24.830 --> 20:26.030
The troops here in Jiyang

20:26.590 --> 20:27.470
are far too few.

20:28.390 --> 20:30.070
And they lack recent combat experience.

20:32.710 --> 20:34.350
You show true leadership.

20:34.510 --> 20:35.430
Unflinching in crisis.

20:36.870 --> 20:37.790
Aren't you

20:38.270 --> 20:39.750
aspiring to be a female general?

20:41.310 --> 20:41.910
20,000 men.

20:42.470 --> 20:43.310
Far better than that

20:43.430 --> 20:44.110
in Que City.

20:45.230 --> 20:46.190
Whether 20,000

20:46.310 --> 20:47.150
or 2,000,

20:47.750 --> 20:48.790
when enemies are outside,

20:49.270 --> 20:50.550
we fight to the death.

20:51.390 --> 20:52.590
Prove those words true.

20:57.910 --> 20:58.670
These 20,000 men

20:59.630 --> 21:00.710
will follow your command.

21:03.230 --> 21:04.190
Wise choice, Commander.

21:04.950 --> 21:06.030
None could lead but me.

21:11.670 --> 21:12.260
Thrust.

21:13.070 --> 21:13.730
Stab.

21:14.660 --> 21:17.380
Down. Chop.

21:17.870 --> 21:19.190
After years without combat,

21:19.510 --> 21:20.630
they look slack.

21:21.390 --> 21:22.910
Such bold claims.

21:23.750 --> 21:24.910
You make our army

21:24.910 --> 21:26.110
sound like brittle clay.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.990
Just a mere woman.

21:28.150 --> 21:29.390
How can you teach us men

21:29.430 --> 21:30.350
battle tactics?

21:30.910 --> 21:32.470
You're gambling

21:32.550 --> 21:33.150
with our lives.

21:35.030 --> 21:35.650
Well?

21:35.870 --> 21:37.030
Care to test me?

21:37.670 --> 21:38.630
Don't waste time.

21:39.950 --> 21:40.710
All ten of you

21:43.350 --> 21:44.670
attack her at once.

21:45.550 --> 21:47.230
You mock us?

21:47.750 --> 21:48.750
I would like to see

21:48.830 --> 21:50.470
how you'll face ten opponents alone.

21:51.310 --> 21:51.810
Commander.

21:52.470 --> 21:54.150
You honor me excessively.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.710
Do you know?

21:59.830 --> 22:00.870
I hear

22:01.110 --> 22:03.510
Mrs. Qiao is challenging
the Jiyang army single-handedly

22:03.790 --> 22:05.950
at the training field.

22:08.110 --> 22:08.790
Is she crazy?

22:21.750 --> 22:22.790
Any more challengers?

22:22.950 --> 22:24.550
- Great!
- Great!

22:25.710 --> 22:26.670
- Great!
- Great!

22:26.750 --> 22:27.310
Now you see

22:27.310 --> 22:28.230
how formidable she is.

22:28.750 --> 22:30.230
Truly the best of Yezhou Garrison.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.190
This scene

22:32.390 --> 22:33.910
looks eerily familiar to me.

22:40.060 --> 22:40.640
Here.

22:43.710 --> 22:44.320
Thank you.

22:45.870 --> 22:47.190
- Amazing!
- Awesome!

22:47.510 --> 22:48.150
Yes.

22:51.270 --> 22:52.150
Incredible!

22:53.470 --> 22:54.750
Didn't I tell you the truth?

22:55.390 --> 22:55.990
Women

22:56.750 --> 22:58.030
are never inferior to men.

22:58.750 --> 22:59.510
Through the ages,

22:59.950 --> 23:00.750
people have claimed

23:01.350 --> 23:02.990
women belong at embroidery frames

23:02.990 --> 23:04.070
and housewifery.

23:04.550 --> 23:05.390
But must we women

23:05.990 --> 23:07.270
be confined to domestic roles

23:07.590 --> 23:08.630
or limited to needlework?

23:09.550 --> 23:10.950
We can write and fight.

23:11.430 --> 23:12.830
We can write literary masterpieces.

23:13.390 --> 23:14.670
We can charge into battle

23:15.070 --> 23:15.910
and earn glory.

23:16.750 --> 23:18.310
We're not just waiting to be saved.

23:19.030 --> 23:20.230
We can save ourselves.

23:23.390 --> 23:23.990
Of course

23:25.030 --> 23:26.230
I won't force you

23:26.750 --> 23:28.190
to fight on battlefields.

23:29.230 --> 23:30.790
But beyond combat,

23:30.990 --> 23:32.350
you can do other things.

23:33.590 --> 23:34.510
Even the tiniest dust

23:34.990 --> 23:36.190
can fill mountains and seas.

23:36.870 --> 23:37.950
The faintest glow

23:38.310 --> 23:39.670
can rival the sun and moon.

23:41.310 --> 23:42.630
I prided myself on noble birth

23:43.390 --> 23:44.910
but remained trapped in stagnation.

23:45.630 --> 23:47.750
I can sell unwanted jewels

23:48.230 --> 23:49.310
to buy

23:49.510 --> 23:50.870
weapons and provisions.

23:51.070 --> 23:54.590
- Me too!
- Me too!

23:54.710 --> 23:55.330
I'll donate.

23:57.470 --> 23:58.630
Those who are poor can learn

23:58.630 --> 23:59.430
medicine from us.

23:59.750 --> 24:01.150
Countless soldiers will need care

24:01.150 --> 24:01.830
later.

24:02.430 --> 24:03.590
Rich or poor, all can learn.

24:10.510 --> 24:11.070
Well?

24:11.630 --> 24:12.310
Am I impressive?

24:13.150 --> 24:14.030
You know why I let you

24:14.030 --> 24:14.830
lead them?

24:15.230 --> 24:15.750
Because

24:17.190 --> 24:18.510
I'm unquestionably capable.

24:23.870 --> 24:25.190
Miss He is so skilled

24:25.230 --> 24:26.030
in martial arts.

24:26.870 --> 24:27.390
She

24:28.030 --> 24:29.230
always defies convention.

24:32.750 --> 24:33.270
Young Master,

24:33.790 --> 24:34.830
Princess Mengji began

24:34.830 --> 24:36.510
evacuating the civilians today.

24:37.350 --> 24:38.550
Shouldn't you join them?

24:39.150 --> 24:40.230
My goal is unfinished.

24:40.790 --> 24:41.710
How can I leave now?

24:41.910 --> 24:43.230
But Jiyang is too dangerous.

24:43.910 --> 24:44.750
Only by staying

24:45.430 --> 24:46.150
can I uncover

24:46.310 --> 24:47.310
Master's true intentions.

24:48.310 --> 24:48.830
Yingxiang,

24:49.750 --> 24:50.790
two paths lie before me.

24:51.190 --> 24:51.750
Either

24:53.110 --> 24:53.990
die in this city

24:55.190 --> 24:55.950
or survive

24:56.150 --> 24:57.590
to confirm my suspicions.

24:58.430 --> 24:59.790
A life of complacency

24:59.910 --> 25:00.870
would be meaningless

25:01.350 --> 25:02.030
even if I return.

25:02.710 --> 25:03.330
Understand?

25:15.910 --> 25:16.430
Keep up.

25:17.870 --> 25:18.950
Everyone, follow me.

25:19.030 --> 25:19.680
Stay close.

25:25.950 --> 25:26.790
Jiyang has become

25:26.950 --> 25:28.030
half-deserted overnight.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.390
Shops stand shuttered.

25:32.910 --> 25:33.830
Only the able-bodied

25:33.990 --> 25:35.110
and those strong enough

25:35.310 --> 25:36.350
could flee.

25:37.510 --> 25:38.710
The old, weak, and ill

25:39.550 --> 25:41.350
can't even join the exodus.

25:42.750 --> 25:43.390
Miss Song.

25:43.870 --> 25:44.870
I know what you'll say.

25:45.430 --> 25:46.310
Save your breath.

25:47.230 --> 25:48.150
As a healer,

25:48.710 --> 25:49.830
I won't abandon people

25:49.830 --> 25:50.470
in crisis.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.430
What are you thinking?

25:54.150 --> 25:55.310
Don't you want me to leave?

25:56.310 --> 25:57.150
Come on!

25:57.590 --> 25:59.030
You haven't conceded defeat yet.

25:59.590 --> 26:00.630
And you want to escape?

26:01.030 --> 26:01.670
Cheng Lisu.

26:01.670 --> 26:02.470
Besides,

26:03.110 --> 26:04.310
you aim to heal the world

26:04.950 --> 26:06.270
and reform medical texts.

26:06.790 --> 26:08.150
No one should obstruct your path.

26:11.270 --> 26:12.350
Cheng Lisu.

26:13.670 --> 26:14.230
This time,

26:14.630 --> 26:15.750
let's see who saves more.

26:16.270 --> 26:17.510
It's also part of the contest.

26:18.190 --> 26:19.310
If you lose,

26:19.710 --> 26:20.550
you'll have to wash

26:20.590 --> 26:21.470
my socks for a year.

26:22.790 --> 26:23.910
You're destined to lose.

26:24.470 --> 26:25.190
There won't be

26:25.390 --> 26:26.510
many women for you to rescue

26:26.630 --> 26:27.190
in combat.

26:28.190 --> 26:29.270
I won't lose.

26:31.070 --> 26:32.270
Then we'll see about that.

26:43.550 --> 26:44.830
If the heavens don't favor us

26:46.310 --> 26:47.470
on the day of battle,

26:48.470 --> 26:49.070
what then?

26:52.550 --> 26:53.910
Every inch of Jiyang's land

26:55.350 --> 26:56.830
can become our burial ground.

26:59.470 --> 27:00.910
This is the conviction

27:02.030 --> 27:03.190
every soldier should possess.

27:04.030 --> 27:06.910
Rather die with shattered wings

27:07.550 --> 27:10.430
than endure separation
amidst the clouds.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.190
Today,

27:17.790 --> 27:18.790
the weather is clear.

27:56.510 --> 27:57.310
What's your plan?

27:58.150 --> 27:59.710
They've suddenly forced their march.

28:00.590 --> 28:02.790
If we want to win with fewer people,

28:03.630 --> 28:04.910
holding fortresses is crucial.

28:17.070 --> 28:17.760
Go.

28:25.110 --> 28:25.870
Be careful.

28:28.790 --> 28:29.350
Hurry.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.270
Go.

28:30.990 --> 28:31.710
Let's go there.

28:32.310 --> 28:32.910
Hurry.

28:33.150 --> 28:34.030
Go.

28:36.430 --> 28:36.990
Young Master,

28:37.430 --> 28:38.630
as the Military Inspector,

28:38.790 --> 28:40.150
you've done more than enough.

28:40.510 --> 28:41.310
You can't fight.

28:41.470 --> 28:42.350
For your safety,

28:42.510 --> 28:43.470
please leave the city.

28:43.790 --> 28:44.590
Leave this to me.

28:45.910 --> 28:47.150
I took on from Her Highness

28:47.470 --> 28:48.230
the evacuation

28:48.230 --> 28:49.510
and resettlement.

28:49.910 --> 28:50.870
I must finish it.

28:51.630 --> 28:52.750
I can't abandon the people

28:52.910 --> 28:53.670
to save myself.

28:54.350 --> 28:54.950
Moreover,

28:55.270 --> 28:56.270
Chai Anxi isn't found.

28:56.630 --> 28:57.470
If I leave alone,

28:57.670 --> 28:58.950
how will I face my master?

28:59.870 --> 29:00.430
But...

29:00.430 --> 29:01.230
I've decided.

29:02.150 --> 29:02.780
Over here.

29:05.390 --> 29:06.150
Move aside!

29:13.110 --> 29:13.950
Thank you, sir.

29:16.990 --> 29:18.230
Anyone else disrupting order

29:19.230 --> 29:20.310
will be executed.

29:24.790 --> 29:26.110
Are you alright, sir?

29:27.550 --> 29:28.430
I'm fine. I'm fine.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.350
Thank you.

29:31.190 --> 29:32.150
There's an empty house

29:32.430 --> 29:33.390
ahead sheltering

29:33.470 --> 29:34.590
lost elders and children.

29:35.110 --> 29:35.630
You can

29:36.270 --> 29:37.430
stay there temporarily

29:37.590 --> 29:38.190
for shelter.

29:38.790 --> 29:39.950
Okay, thank you.

29:40.670 --> 29:41.190
Yingxiang.

29:41.550 --> 29:42.270
Escort the elder.

29:42.470 --> 29:42.990
Yes.

29:45.110 --> 29:45.750
Thank you.

30:20.870 --> 30:21.390
Mr. Chu.

30:22.990 --> 30:23.550
Mr. Chu.

30:26.110 --> 30:26.790
Are you alright?

30:29.070 --> 30:29.590
I'm fine.

30:29.910 --> 30:30.430
Thank you.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.750
When I bought the sugar painting,

30:33.910 --> 30:34.870
I noticed you seemed

30:35.110 --> 30:36.110
uneasy around fire.

30:36.510 --> 30:38.430
Mr. Chu, are you afraid of fire?

30:39.470 --> 30:40.590
(Smoke him out to cleanse)

30:40.710 --> 30:41.350
(bad luck!)

30:41.830 --> 30:43.230
- Yes!
- Yes!

30:43.310 --> 30:43.830
Do it.

30:44.430 --> 30:45.110
Smoke him out.

30:45.390 --> 30:46.430
Your mother eloped.

30:46.470 --> 30:47.230
Serves you right.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.830
You fatherless boy.

30:49.030 --> 30:49.950
Illegitimate.

30:49.990 --> 30:51.190
Don't insult my mother!

30:54.190 --> 30:55.270
Mother.

30:55.430 --> 30:56.790
Mother.

30:59.430 --> 31:00.430
It's okay.

31:00.430 --> 31:01.590
Mother.

31:02.870 --> 31:03.390
Mr. Chu.

31:06.910 --> 31:07.470
Mr. Chu.

31:07.830 --> 31:08.390
I'm sorry.

31:08.630 --> 31:09.470
I shouldn't ask you.

31:11.310 --> 31:11.940
It's okay.

31:12.910 --> 31:13.710
Thank you.

31:14.910 --> 31:15.430
Mr. Chu.

31:15.630 --> 31:16.950
You've already thanked me.

31:18.350 --> 31:19.310
I just remembered it.

31:19.550 --> 31:20.510
I have a garment

31:20.510 --> 31:22.110
made of mermaid silk fabric.

31:22.510 --> 31:23.350
The merchant claimed

31:23.350 --> 31:24.750
clothes crafted from this material

31:25.070 --> 31:25.910
are swordproof

31:26.110 --> 31:27.030
and resistant to fire.

31:27.830 --> 31:28.550
I'll have it sent

31:28.590 --> 31:29.510
to you later, Mr. Chu.

31:29.750 --> 31:30.350
This way,

31:30.350 --> 31:31.470
you won't fear flames.

31:33.030 --> 31:33.910
It's settled then.

31:34.710 --> 31:36.350
Mr. Chu, I'll go patrol.

31:36.590 --> 31:37.390
Stay cautious.

31:37.790 --> 31:38.470
Be careful.

31:41.230 --> 31:41.790
Let's go.

31:49.630 --> 31:50.550
We just got news.

31:51.150 --> 31:51.830
The Wutuo Army

31:51.830 --> 31:52.630
suddenly sped up.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.390
They're 20 li

31:54.390 --> 31:55.070
outside

31:55.430 --> 31:56.150
the south gate.

31:56.630 --> 31:57.190
I suspect

31:57.350 --> 31:58.670
they've got news

31:58.910 --> 32:00.150
about you being in Jiyang.

32:00.750 --> 32:01.870
They've always feared you.

32:02.190 --> 32:03.470
Knowing you're here,

32:03.870 --> 32:04.830
they'll surely exploit

32:05.110 --> 32:06.190
the lack of coordination

32:06.350 --> 32:07.430
between you and the troops

32:07.710 --> 32:08.670
to strike swiftly.

32:08.990 --> 32:10.750
For us to overcome their numbers,

32:10.950 --> 32:13.150
speed will be crucial.

32:13.550 --> 32:14.240
So,

32:14.630 --> 32:15.670
this is our opportunity.

32:16.070 --> 32:16.590
True.

32:16.790 --> 32:18.230
Our troops' morale is high.

32:18.630 --> 32:19.870
Civilians are encouraged.

32:20.190 --> 32:20.990
Both united

32:21.070 --> 32:21.870
to strike.

32:22.150 --> 32:23.630
This is our moment to repel Wutuo.

32:24.270 --> 32:25.030
But

32:25.310 --> 32:26.430
Jiyang's limited forces

32:26.670 --> 32:27.830
remain our critical weakness.

32:28.150 --> 32:29.030
We need unusual ideas

32:29.230 --> 32:30.430
to reverse our fortunes.

32:30.590 --> 32:31.150
This time,

32:31.790 --> 32:32.750
the Wutuo commander

32:33.070 --> 32:33.790
is Huyate.

32:34.750 --> 32:35.670
Courageous in combat

32:35.910 --> 32:37.230
but stubbornly self-assured,

32:37.950 --> 32:39.350
with limited skill

32:39.710 --> 32:40.550
in formations.

32:40.870 --> 32:43.230
Disrupting his formation

32:43.750 --> 32:44.750
is key to victory.

32:45.790 --> 32:47.390
I've heard of Huyate.

32:47.910 --> 32:49.230
His heavy-armored troops

32:49.390 --> 32:50.150
are tough.

32:50.630 --> 32:51.910
But it decides the battle.

32:52.790 --> 32:54.230
You seem well-informed

32:54.550 --> 32:55.310
about Huyate.

32:58.790 --> 32:59.350
Commander,

32:59.750 --> 33:00.510
after all,

33:00.510 --> 33:01.790
I aspire to be a general.

33:02.150 --> 33:03.830
It's my duty

33:03.990 --> 33:04.830
to study

33:04.990 --> 33:05.870
potential adversaries.

33:06.590 --> 33:07.140
See?

33:07.430 --> 33:08.830
This knowledge proves useful now.

33:09.390 --> 33:09.950
Commander.

33:11.830 --> 33:12.480
Commander.

33:13.190 --> 33:14.470
During the evacuation today,

33:14.870 --> 33:15.630
my men stationed

33:15.670 --> 33:16.630
at checkpoints

33:17.110 --> 33:17.630
didn't find

33:17.670 --> 33:18.470
Chai Anxi.

33:19.150 --> 33:19.790
He likely

33:19.950 --> 33:20.990
hasn't fled the city yet.

33:21.390 --> 33:22.510
In that case,

33:23.030 --> 33:23.910
he probably plans

33:23.950 --> 33:24.870
to escape

33:25.030 --> 33:25.950
once the battle begins.

33:26.070 --> 33:26.870
But by then,

33:26.910 --> 33:28.150
the city will be surrounded,

33:28.550 --> 33:29.830
and we'll be stretched too thin.

33:31.790 --> 33:32.910
Continue the checks.

33:33.270 --> 33:34.150
Stay vigilant.

33:34.830 --> 33:36.390
If war truly breaks out,

33:38.030 --> 33:38.620
our priority

33:39.150 --> 33:40.150
is to defend Jiyang.

33:40.990 --> 33:41.570
Yes.

34:06.270 --> 34:07.230
(I've guarded)

34:08.310 --> 34:09.949
(this city for over two decades.)

34:11.429 --> 34:12.070
(This time,)

34:13.270 --> 34:14.750
(I will surely protect it again.)

34:52.389 --> 34:52.949
(Master.)

34:53.469 --> 34:54.230
The Mengji throne

34:54.350 --> 34:55.909
doesn't require marriage alliances.

34:56.510 --> 34:58.150
Through generations
of rulers' diligence,

34:58.230 --> 34:59.230
they won over the people.

34:59.470 --> 35:01.870
Diligent governance is crucial,

35:02.110 --> 35:03.710
but through history,

35:03.870 --> 35:05.590
no woman has ever inherited the throne.

35:05.830 --> 35:07.430
Hongjin is Prince Mengji's sole child.

35:07.590 --> 35:08.510
Legitimate.

35:08.950 --> 35:09.990
(Taoist Yunji)
A brave and smart woman

35:10.150 --> 35:11.110
rivals any man.

35:11.150 --> 35:12.830
These are just your personal views.

35:13.590 --> 35:15.110
Though laws never stipulated

35:15.830 --> 35:17.830
only men can inherit the throne,

35:18.790 --> 35:20.590
some traditions

35:21.270 --> 35:22.750
have become unspoken rules

35:22.910 --> 35:24.190
in the public's mind.

35:24.630 --> 35:25.910
Her gender alone

35:26.070 --> 35:28.070
gives opponents ground to challenge her.

35:28.550 --> 35:30.470
Hongjin will prove to the world

35:31.110 --> 35:32.310
she surpasses her ancestors.

35:33.910 --> 35:35.150
I'll stand by her side.

35:36.150 --> 35:37.470
The nobles in Jiyang

35:37.590 --> 35:39.030
won't grant her that time.

35:39.710 --> 35:40.390
Now,

35:40.630 --> 35:41.630
only marriage

35:42.430 --> 35:44.190
can stabilize the situation

35:44.430 --> 35:45.630
and her position swiftly.

35:45.790 --> 35:46.750
I believe

35:47.230 --> 35:48.470
heaven never seals all doors.

35:48.710 --> 35:49.750
We can defy our destiny.

35:50.190 --> 35:51.870
You two might challenge fate,

35:52.470 --> 35:54.390
but victory demands sacrifice.

35:55.270 --> 35:56.550
Don't tell me

35:56.830 --> 35:57.830
you fear no hardship.

35:58.910 --> 35:59.710
The suffering

36:00.150 --> 36:02.350
won't just burden you two.

36:03.110 --> 36:04.190
When turmoil erupts,

36:04.950 --> 36:06.430
countless Jiyang citizens

36:06.630 --> 36:07.310
will inevitably

36:07.310 --> 36:09.390
endure hardships because of you.

36:12.550 --> 36:13.150
Even so,

36:13.830 --> 36:14.950
please let me go down

36:14.990 --> 36:15.630
and see her.

36:15.790 --> 36:16.590
Let me tell her.

36:17.070 --> 36:17.870
She's still waiting.

36:17.870 --> 36:18.910
I can't break my promise.

36:18.950 --> 36:19.520
Master.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.310
Master!

36:37.070 --> 36:38.430
Confine him under strict watch.

36:38.750 --> 36:39.990
Prevent him from descending.

36:57.190 --> 36:57.870
Master.

36:59.030 --> 36:59.870
Her Highness

37:00.390 --> 37:01.630
will get married in three days.

37:02.510 --> 37:03.510
It's all over.

37:04.550 --> 37:06.030
Abandon your stubbornness.

37:28.920 --> 37:31.710
♪Through endless nights, I walk alone♪

37:31.920 --> 37:35.560
♪Heartache swirls like ceaseless winds♪

37:39.700 --> 37:42.530
♪Yet I yearn to stand opposed to you♪

37:43.750 --> 37:45.070
Since you didn't come then,

37:46.470 --> 37:47.150
why seek meeting

37:48.390 --> 37:49.710
right now?

37:50.770 --> 37:53.500
♪Upon towering fortress walls♪

37:53.750 --> 37:56.350
♪Brooding over lamented pasts♪

37:56.530 --> 37:59.390
♪Where shall light be found♪

37:59.510 --> 38:01.540
♪Once♪

38:01.970 --> 38:04.380
♪I had an unbreakable faith♪

38:04.660 --> 38:07.580
♪If given another life♪

38:07.860 --> 38:10.110
♪Never yield♪

38:10.280 --> 38:12.920
♪I'm shrouded in darkness♪

38:12.920 --> 38:16.320
♪Resent old dreams like drifting clouds♪

38:16.480 --> 38:18.180
♪Heartache♪

38:18.360 --> 38:21.410
♪Resenting the lonely years♪

38:22.050 --> 38:25.850
♪Why persist♪

38:26.430 --> 38:30.550
♪Tears crystallize to frost♪

38:31.900 --> 38:34.720
♪Clutching stubborn obsessions♪

38:34.720 --> 38:38.060
♪Yet falling into folly♪

38:38.310 --> 38:40.100
♪Fading into oblivion♪

38:40.100 --> 38:43.420
♪Yet memories surge everywhere♪

38:44.060 --> 38:46.850
♪After the separation♪

38:46.980 --> 38:52.870
♪My heart feels adrift♪

38:52.870 --> 38:53.510
We'll go

38:53.910 --> 38:55.590
to the camp with Her Highness later

38:55.950 --> 38:57.030
to await our victory.

38:58.350 --> 38:58.870
Young Master,

38:59.430 --> 39:00.470
what's in this package?

39:00.910 --> 39:01.670
Is it important?

39:03.510 --> 39:04.310
Miss He gave me

39:04.910 --> 39:06.470
this protective gear.

39:17.030 --> 39:17.830
This is war,

39:18.110 --> 39:18.990
not child's play.

39:19.150 --> 39:20.070
Why are you going?

39:20.510 --> 39:21.070
Go join

39:21.270 --> 39:22.070
Ms. Wei's group.

39:22.510 --> 39:23.470
I'm serious.

39:23.830 --> 39:25.390
Our soldiers bleed outside.

39:25.430 --> 39:26.070
As a healer,

39:26.150 --> 39:27.070
I must contribute.

39:27.710 --> 39:28.590
You're a doctor

39:28.590 --> 39:29.590
who just treats women.

39:29.630 --> 39:30.670
You should go join them.

39:31.030 --> 39:31.870
Stop hindering me.

39:33.510 --> 39:34.020
I...

39:37.710 --> 39:38.230
I'm in.

39:38.750 --> 39:39.350
We can watch

39:39.670 --> 39:40.430
each other's backs.

39:55.570 --> 39:57.270
(Huyate, Wutuo Commander)

39:57.270 --> 39:58.270
Attack!

40:13.430 --> 40:14.080
Commander,

40:14.670 --> 40:15.750
let me lead the elites

40:16.110 --> 40:18.150
to draw away Huyate
and the heavy armor units.

40:18.950 --> 40:19.830
He Yan, listen!

40:24.150 --> 40:25.030
Come back alive.

40:27.030 --> 40:27.870
Yes!

40:28.510 --> 40:30.670
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:30.770 --> 40:34.690
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:34.870 --> 40:36.810
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:36.900 --> 40:41.830
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:53.930 --> 40:55.340
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:55.540 --> 40:56.950
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:57.220 --> 41:00.030
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:00.340 --> 41:01.730
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:01.790 --> 41:03.190
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:03.340 --> 41:05.130
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:06.330 --> 41:07.800
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:07.970 --> 41:09.260
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:09.440 --> 41:11.830
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:12.030 --> 41:14.080
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:15.210 --> 41:17.040
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:19.000 --> 41:21.920
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:22.010 --> 41:24.670
♪There must always be a longing♪

41:25.130 --> 41:30.190
